  <h2>Project engagements</h2>
  <p>Client projects are governed by separate written agreements, which take precedence over these terms.</p>
  <h2>Governing law</h2>
  <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the Emirate of Abu Dhabi and the federal laws of the United Arab Emirates.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
